      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791238708382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• verifier isolated from agent writes (mimo-verifier-not-isolated)\n• terminal hooks / testmain / conftest not plantable\n• git history not readable (mimo-git-history-readable)\n• network: mimo-network-public → no network guarantee\n• setup-healthcheck-only: runners skipping setup are ungradable\n• split groups must not straddle train / held-out\n• MiMo published recipe (§4.2.6, pp14-16): scrub caches/Git, isolate net,\n   hack-agent probes + offline audits — their report, not our measurement",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "p-iso",
      "originalText": "• verifier isolated from agent writes (mimo-verifier-not-isolated)\n• terminal hooks / testmain / conftest not plantable\n• git history not readable (mimo-git-history-readable)\n• network: mimo-network-public → no network guarantee\n• setup-healthcheck-only: runners skipping setup are ungradable\n• split groups must not straddle train / held-out\n• MiMo published recipe (§4.2.6, pp14-16): scrub caches/Git, isolate net,\n   hack-agent probes + offline audits — their report, not our measurement",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
